 Introduction <span style="font-size:14.0pt; 
line-height:115%;color:#7030A0">Government Meera Girls’ College, situated in 
the picturesque city of Lakes, Udaipur, is the first and the largest 
postgraduate women’s college in southern Rajasthan. The college is affiliated 
with Mohanlal Sukhadia University, Udaipur. <span style="font-size:14.0pt; 
line-height:115%;color:#7030A0">The college is named after ‘MEERA’ who 
renounced royal life and embraced sainthood in her devotion to Lord Krishna; 
thus, a symbol of dedication, trueness and honesty for attaining life-goals 
through educational values. <span style="font-size:14.0pt; 
line-height:115%;color:#7030A0">The college has witnessed growth over the 
years- from offering courses at the intermediate level since its inception in 
1956, promoted to undergraduate level in 1959 and since 1977 offering 
postgraduate courses. Currently, 26 UG and 19 PG programs are offered in Arts, 
Commerce and Science faculty. College is maintaining high academic standards 
and catering educational needs of girl students in the tribal heartland of 
Rajasthan. <span style="font-size:14.0pt; 
line-height:115%;color:#7030A0">To develop the overall personality of the 
students’ various co-curricular activities are regularly conducted by NSS, NCC, 
YDC and Rangering. These sundry activities explore the latent potential of 
students and provide a platform to express. The students of Meera Girls College 
have earned accolades in sports under competent guidance and training. The 
Woman Study Cell, inter-disciplinary forum, Career and Placement Cells provide 
unparalleled opportunities for girls to display their creative potentials and 
talent. <span style="font-size:14.0pt; 
line-height:115%;color:#7030A0">The college is well-equipped with the necessary 
infrastructure like a separate library building, administrative block, computer 
lab, internet wi-fi facility, three hostels with comfortable residential 
facilities. Central to the course delivery or student learning, the qualified 
teaching faculty devoted to their responsibilities. College provides convivial 
environs and freedom to its faculties for teaching, research, and other 
professional responsibilities. 









 <span style="font-size:14.0pt; 
line-height:115%;color:#7030A0">The college has been accredited ‘A’ grade by 
NAAC valid up toMay 2027 and is also a beneficiary of RUSA since 2015. 
