mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">Govt. Meera Girls’ College 
being number one amongst the government girls Colleges of Udaipur, Rajasthan is 
situated at Meera marg near Panchawati area in the heart of Udaipur city. This 
College is the center of attraction due to its location and easy accessibility for 
all the intellectuals who come to visit Udaipur, the City of Lakes. The N.H. 8 
passes through the North and North East peripheries of the college. The college 
is surrounded by many landmarks in form of Govt. offices, as collectorate in 
the Southeast direction just 500 meters away, Lok Kala Mandal in the West of 
the College building, famous Sukhadia Circle in the North and Govt. M.B. 
Hospital in the South. Besides these, the Central Bus Depot is about 3.5 km 
away and City Railway Station is about 4 km away in South West direction from 
the College premises. 
